+/*
+ * REPLAY_ISIZE is sized for an OPEN response with delegation:
+ *   4(status) + 8(stateid) + 20(changeinfo) + 4(rflags) +
+ *   8(verifier) + 4(deleg. type) + 8(deleg. stateid) +
