+ * lock owner, which can be up to 1024 bytes (NFS4_OPAQUE_LIMIT). Responses
+ * larger than REPLAY_ISIZE are not cached in rp_ibuf; only rp_status is
+ * saved. Enlarging this constant increases the size of every
